{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1681.unity3d","item_key":"commands[1].text","source_sha256":"ba025ddc5c5f70d5b11fdebdd4a95e6bbf28103a204c4b39b122871b7043236c","ja":"ヒーローを観に","zh":"去看英雄","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1681.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"46fc8c0fb895d9de47d42d164a2451234716a89262ccc9902345e02696c0342f","ja":"瑞希さん、今日は付き合ってくれて、\nありがとうございます！","zh":"瑞希，今天谢谢你\n能陪我一起来！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1681.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"cb021cc89360995ef08b6e9cf4decde3d119649f0ee77f09b6b7e14a26cc842f","ja":"いえ、ヒーローショーは私も興味があったので。\n……ワクワク♪","zh":"不，因为我也对英雄秀很感兴趣。\n……好兴奋♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1681.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"5246f85ac38e1d20bfd8a8b0a66ab69c39db1806b776475c393bdac07795b1c3","ja":"よかった。この前の公演が終わってから、\n一度、生でヒーローショーを見てみたかったんです。","zh":"太好了。自从上次的公演结束之后，\n我就一直想在现场看一次英雄秀。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1681.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"5a82acce5f27d911e7d87afb9dfd7db1e365f984eba6548c80d5df51d1b83ef8","ja":"人気のあるヒーローみたいですね。\n観客席がかなり埋まっています。","zh":"看来是很受欢迎的英雄呢。\n观众席差不多都坐满了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1681.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"c3ae0a98b0f5b85d4fad341cee2f2a732f6bc4843971805e5b99c1362edba257","ja":"本当ですね、まだ始まるまで時間があるのに……。\nあ、あっちの角があいてますよ。行きましょう。","zh":"确实呢，明明离开始还有一段时间……\n啊，那边的拐角空着呢。我们过去吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1681.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"c400b0c9a4ad75e2dda43ff79f863db11a2ccedbf5042cae37c024eafae61bab","ja":"「はやく来ないかな～、レッド！」\n「エターナルフォレスト、やってくれるかな？」","zh":"“红战士还不快点来啊～！”\n“会表演永恒之森吗？”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1681.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"bb20efea6de517814be9c62cb333b0e4392f5235917b4960d34954409dbefa95","ja":"ふふっ、子どもたちも盛り上がってますね♪","zh":"呵呵，孩子们也情绪很高涨呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1681.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"310e817640df45b150156d1f57df94654fa85e2f4117bc00509da27d1bc2f08e","ja":"はい。必殺技や登場人物の名前もよく知っていて。\n……さすがだぞ。","zh":"是的。必杀技和登场人物的名字也都一清二楚。\n……真不愧是你啊。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1681.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"e64062d89ef840de0fdeb1fb6e0c986cd76eb6e231d1388f0cbbfe200fd3268d","ja":"今日のヒーローのこと、私も少し調べてきましたが、\n解説してもらっていいでしょうか？　……プリーズ。","zh":"关于今天的英雄，我也稍微调查了一下，\n能请你为我解说一下吗？……拜托了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1681.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"b88c343c2f2a72cdc50864c5e4e48905f3726ecae36ccf6517bb96ba87316fd2","ja":"はい、もちろんです！　ガイドブックを読みこんで\nきましたし、番組もチェックしたので……。","zh":"好的，没问题！我不仅仔细阅读了\n旅行指南，也确认过节目内容了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1681.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"c9bed3bfb026e560f4da0655d9aff924fe47dfb9f23339b324f224069a24035f","ja":"まずは、ストーリーからおさらいしましょう♪","zh":"先从剧情开始回顾吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1681.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"22cc9b1f42b39d9e1b97f2e32a23d5ac4d240d8446cd7cede1d747705ab1b6eb","ja":"……というわけで、復讐のための戦いに、\n敵の信念やラブロマンスが絡み合ってくるんです！","zh":"……事情就是这样，复仇之战中\n还交织着敌人的信念与浪漫恋情呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1681.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"1f88f75974785e4781acbf7786ac9c4b68da92f102cfc5f52bd5441fc1dff3f6","ja":"おお……ハラハラとドキドキがいっぱいですね。\nこれは目が離せないぞ。","zh":"哦哦……真是充满了惊险与心跳加速呢。\n这可让人移不开视线啊。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1681.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"6b63a65d9fd76af549dd3ba9147bbbab3e657a19f9fed220677a87ec33586d8c","ja":"ですよね！　それじゃあ次は、\nレッドが編み出した必殺技についてなんですけど……。","zh":"就是说嘛！那么接下来，\n想跟您聊聊红战士自创的必杀技……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
